<title>USA: Saginaw, Texas $2.190 mln won by Smith Barney.</title>
<headline>Saginaw, Texas $2.190 mln won by Smith Barney.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney said it won $2.190 million of Saginaw, Texas, waterworks and sewer system revenue bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.3394 percent.</p>
